<title>PHILIPPINES: Planters Bank declares cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Planters Bank declares cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Planters Development Bank said on Tuesday its board had approved a cash dividend of 11.2752 pesos per share for Class C preferred shareholders as of March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>In an advisory to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the bank said the cash dividend will be payable on April 7, 1997.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
